{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Coded Black",
    "steam_appid": 3669540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/8c085cf344ca866b5c25e390b950e4a2.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coded Black</strong> is a bold, narrative-driven experience that immerses players in the hidden and haunting histories of anti-Blackness in the US and UK. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an experience designed to be difficult \u2013 mentally and emotionally. Drawing from primary sources, historical records and scholarly analysis, <i>Coded Black</i> offers a journey through past atrocities and moments of triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/6569956c28649ebe2c7769b8b95868c1.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore two distinct, atmospheric scenes\u00a0 \u2013 a plantation and a modern 20th-century city \u2013 each filled with real historical documents and audio visual storytelling. With a structure that surfaces different content in each run, <i>Coded Black</i> is a narrative crafted for both personal reflection and educational engagement.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/88254e56719368199eda096cb97fcf87.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/4bc64e385ad8d05eb43497f98ba867ff.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the darkness, <i>Coded Black</i> also shines. Players can find glowing \u201cballs of light\u201d that reveal stories of Black achievement, resilience, and humanity \u2013 offering powerful moments of reflection and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blurring the lines between game and museum exhibit, this is an experience about witnessing, understanding and feeling the weight of history through an interactive lens.<br><br>   _</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is free to play and designed to be used as both an interactive exhibit and a teaching tool. A companion website provides expanded resources, bibliographies, and theoretical materials not included in the game itself.</i><br><br><i></i><br><br><i>For information about the game, its creators and sources, visit codedblack.info.</i> <br> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/8c085cf344ca866b5c25e390b950e4a2.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coded Black</strong> is a bold, narrative-driven experience that immerses players in the hidden and haunting histories of anti-Blackness in the US and UK. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an experience designed to be difficult \u2013 mentally and emotionally. Drawing from primary sources, historical records and scholarly analysis, <i>Coded Black</i> offers a journey through past atrocities and moments of triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/6569956c28649ebe2c7769b8b95868c1.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore two distinct, atmospheric scenes\u00a0 \u2013 a plantation and a modern 20th-century city \u2013 each filled with real historical documents and audio visual storytelling. With a structure that surfaces different content in each run, <i>Coded Black</i> is a narrative crafted for both personal reflection and educational engagement.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/88254e56719368199eda096cb97fcf87.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669540/extras/4bc64e385ad8d05eb43497f98ba867ff.avif?t=1749194946\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the darkness, <i>Coded Black</i> also shines. Players can find glowing \u201cballs of light\u201d that reveal stories of Black achievement, resilience, and humanity \u2013 offering powerful moments of reflection and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blurring the lines between game and museum exhibit, this is an experience about witnessing, understanding and feeling the weight of history through an interactive lens.<br><br>   _</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is free to play and designed to be used as both an interactive exhibit and a teaching tool. A companion website provides expanded resources, bibliographies, and theoretical materials not included in the game itself.</i><br><br><i></i><br><br><i>For information about the game, its creators and sources, visit codedblack.info.</i> <br> </p>",
    "short_description": "A narrative-driven social justice game exploring the suppressed histories of anti-Blackness in the US and UK. Confront racial injustice and discover moments of Black resilience and humanity through storytelling and historical evidence.",
